{"1561920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rosemary's Fate Life Worth Living", "steam_appid": 1561920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [1665940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>, listen, react… <strong>or die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A visual compass</i>, immersive <i>ambient</i> sound, and <i>original music</i> guide you through the dark monastery halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravure-style <strong>hand-drawn images</strong> briefly pierce the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Put on your headphones.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound is your only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Voice acting</i> channels late-20th-century <i>B-movie vibes</i> to set the tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll start with a short tutorial — then, <strong>you’re on your own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 achievements to unlock.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Challenging by design. Satisfying by intent.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the tough classics of the ‘80s and ‘90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We won’t reveal too much, but here’s <strong>what awaits you</strong> in the first few locations…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 1 – Run. Or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 2 – Just reach the door at the end. Simple? Maybe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 3 – Talk… but know this: one person here might still be breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 4 – Trust the cat, not the human. Or — yeah, die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 5 – Accept the teleport. Or… well, don’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 6 – The way out is hard to find. Dying? Not so much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most won’t reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you do, the finale may surprise you — and remind you that <strong>life is worth living</strong>, even if it takes twenty deaths to prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still curious? Time to begin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561920/extras/7c1115c5fdfca7fff03572d68135a7b1.poster.avif?t=1770379159\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561920/extras/7c1115c5fdfca7fff03572d68135a7b1.webm?t=1770379159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>, listen, react… <strong>or die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A visual compass</i>, immersive <i>ambient</i> sound, and <i>original music</i> guide you through the dark monastery halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravure-style <strong>hand-drawn images</strong> briefly pierce the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Put on your headphones.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound is your only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Voice acting</i> channels late-20th-century <i>B-movie vibes</i> to set the tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll start with a short tutorial — then, <strong>you’re on your own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 achievements to unlock.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Challenging by design. Satisfying by intent.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the tough classics of the ‘80s and ‘90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We won’t reveal too much, but here’s <strong>what awaits you</strong> in the first few locations…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 1 – Run. Or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 2 – Just reach the door at the end. Simple? Maybe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 3 – Talk… but know this: one person here might still be breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 4 – Trust the cat, not the human. Or — yeah, die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 5 – Accept the teleport. Or… well, don’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location 6 – The way out is hard to find. Dying? Not so much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most won’t reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you do, the finale may surprise you — and remind you that <strong>life is worth living</strong>, even if it takes twenty deaths to prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still curious? Time to begin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561920/extras/7c1115c5fdfca7fff03572d68135a7b1.poster.avif?t=1770379159\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561920/extras/7c1115c5fdfca7fff03572d68135a7b1.webm?t=1770379159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Listen closely. With hand-drawn visuals and the help of a cat named Blinky, escape Dr. Lazarus’s trap and uncover the truth buried in an audio-visual journey through the past.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<br><str